<title>CANADA: SR Telecom wins $12 million in new orders.</title>
<headline>SR Telecom wins $12 million in new orders.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SR Telecom Inc said on Thursday that it signed a C$6 million contract with Egypt's ARENTO telecommunications organization.</p>
<p>SR Telecom said it would supply seven SR500-s telephone systems to ARENTO, which would be shipped in the first two quarters of 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it also received a C$6 million expansion order from the Rural Telephone Services Company of Thailand. SR Telecom signed an C$86 million contract with RTS on Oct 7.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
